+### Semantic Adjudication for Monetary Totals
+
+When several OCR lines contain plausible monetary totals, determine the target
+field from label semantics before applying confidence, frequency, magnitude, or
+page-position heuristics:
+
+1. Normalize labels before matching and preserve original-line provenance.
+2. Apply task exclusions as hard constraints before candidate ranking.
+3. Prefer the final payable calculation stage, subject to task keyword order.
+4. Do not let repetition decide semantics across different candidate classes.
+5. Do not select by largest or last number alone; use label/value proximity.
+6. Audit the winner and rejected alternatives before materialization.
